    {
      "source": "<code>r2dbcCustomConversions</code> - customized R2DBC conversions.",
      "translation": "<code>r2dbcCustomConversions</code> - 自定义的 R2DBC 转换。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Register custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>s in a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a> object if required. These\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a> will be registered with the <a href=\"../convert/MappingR2dbcConverter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.convert\"><code>MappingR2dbcConverter</code></a> and\n<a href=\"#r2dbcMappingContext(java.util.Optional,org.springframework.data.r2dbc.convert.R2dbcCustomConversions,org.springframework.data.relational.RelationalManagedTypes)\"><code>r2dbcMappingContext(Optional, R2dbcCustomConversions, RelationalManagedTypes)</code></a>. Returns an empty\n<a href=\"../convert/R2dbcCustomConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.convert\"><code>R2dbcCustomConversions</code></a> instance by default. Override <a href=\"#getCustomConverters()\"><code>getCustomConverters()</code></a> to supply custom\nconverters.",
      "translation": "如果需要使用，可在 `CustomConversions` 对象中注册自定义的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>`。这些 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a>` 将被注册到 `<a href=\"../convert/MappingR2dbcConverter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.convert\"><code>MappingR2dbcConverter</code></a>` 和 `<a href=\"#r2dbcMappingContext(java.util.Optional,org.springframework.data.r2dbc.convert.R2dbcCustomConversions,org.springframework.data.relational.RelationalManagedTypes)\"><code>r2dbcMappingContext(Optional, R2dbcCustomConversions, RelationalManagedTypes)</code></a>` 中。默认情况下，返回一个空的 `<a href=\"../convert/R2dbcCustomConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.convert\"><code>R2dbcCustomConversions</code></a>` 实例。通过重写 `<a href=\"#getCustomConverters()\"><code>getCustomConverters()</code></a>` 来提供自定义转换器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a R2DBC <code>ConnectionFactory</code>. Annotate with <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Bean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>Bean</code></a> in case you want to expose a\n<code>ConnectionFactory</code> instance to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个 R2DBC <code>ConnectionFactory</code>。如果您希望将 <code>ConnectionFactory</code> 实例暴露给 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>，请使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Bean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>Bean</code></a> 进行注解。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <a href=\"../dialect/R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a> for the given <code>ConnectionFactory</code>. This method attempts to resolve a\n<a href=\"../dialect/R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a> from <code>ConnectionFactoryMetadata</code>. Override this method to specify a dialect\ninstead of attempting to resolve one.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <code>ConnectionFactory</code> 返回一个 <a href=\"../dialect/R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a>。此方法尝试从 <code>ConnectionFactoryMetadata</code> 解析出 <a href=\"../dialect/R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a>。若要指定方言而非尝试解析，请重写此方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Register custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>s in a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a> object if required.",
      "translation": "如有需要，可在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a> 对象中注册自定义的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the base packages to scan for R2DBC mapped entities at startup. Returns the package name of the\nconfiguration class' (the concrete class, not this one here) by default. So if you have a\n<code>com.acme.AppConfig</code> extending <a href=\"AbstractR2dbcConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.config\"><code>AbstractR2dbcConfiguration</code></a> the base package will be considered\n<code>com.acme</code> unless the method is overridden to implement alternate behavior.",
      "translation": "返回在启动时用于扫描 R2DBC 映射实体的基础包。默认情况下，返回配置类（具体类，而非此处所示的此类）的包名。因此，如果您有一个继承自 <a href=\"AbstractR2dbcConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.config\"><code>AbstractR2dbcConfiguration</code></a> 的 <code>com.acme.AppConfig</code>，则基础包将被视为 <code>com.acme</code>，除非重写该方法以实现其他行为。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Scans the mapping base package for classes annotated with <a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/Table.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>Table</code></a>. By default, it scans for entities in all\npackages returned by <a href=\"#getMappingBasePackages()\"><code>getMappingBasePackages()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "扫描带有<a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/Table.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping 中的注解接口\"><code>Table</code></a>注解的映射基础包中的类。默认情况下，它会扫描由<a href=\"#getMappingBasePackages()\"><code>getMappingBasePackages()</code></a>返回的所有包中的实体。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <a href=\"../dialect/R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a> for the given <code>ConnectionFactory</code>.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <code>ConnectionFactory</code> 返回一个 <a href=\"../dialect/R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
